//   { name: "Bob", age: 25 },
//   { name: "Alice", age: 30 },
//   { name: "Charlie", age: 30 }
// ]

// Explanation:
// The array of users is sorted first by age in ascending order. When ages are equal,
// the users are further sorted by name in ascending order.

